"},"overview":[{"en":"Hubbell Incorporated (herein referred to as \"Hubbell\", the \"Company\", the \"registrant\", \"we\", \"our\" or \"us\", which references shall include its divisions and subsidiaries as the context may require) was founded as a proprietorship in 1888, and was incorporated in Connecticut in 1905. Recognized for our innovation, quality, and deep commitment to serving our customers for over 135 years, Hubbell is a world-class manufacturer of electrical and utility solutions, with more than 75 brands used around the world. We provide utility and electrical solutions that enable our customers to operate critical infrastructure reliably and efficiently, and we empower and energize communities through innovative solutions supporting energy infrastructure In Front of the Meter, on The Edge, and Behind the Meter. In Front of the Meter is where utilities transmit and distribute energy to their customers. The ","zh":"Hubbell Incorporated（本文中称为“Hubbell”、“公司”、“注册人”、“我们”、“我们的”或“我们的”，根据上下文可能需要，提及的内容应包括其部门和子公司）作为独资企业成立于 1888 年，并于 1905 年在康涅狄格州注册成立。 Hubbell 因其创新、质量和超过 135 年为客户服务的坚定承诺而受到认可，是一家世界一流的电气和公用事业解决方案制造商，在全球拥有超过 75 个品牌。我们提供公用事业和电力解决方案，使客户能够可靠、高效地运营关键基础设施，并通过支持表前、边缘和表后能源基础设施的创新解决方案为社区提供支持和活力。電錶前是公用事業公司向客戶傳輸和分配能源的地方。這"},{"en":"Products are either sourced complete, manufactured or assembled by subsidiaries in the United States, Canada, Puerto Rico, Mexico, China, the United Kingdom (\"UK\"), Brazil, Australia, Spain, Ireland, and the Republic of the Philippines. The Company also participates in joint ventures in Hong Kong and the Republic of the Philippines, and maintains offices in Singapore, Italy, China, India, Mexico, South Korea, Chile, and countries in the Middle East.","zh":""},{"en":"Hubbell Utility Solutions has leading positions In Front of the Meter and on The Edge. The Utility Solutions segment (63% of consolidated revenues in 2025, 64% in 2024 and 61% in 2023) consists of businesses that enable the grid to conduct, communicate and control energy across utility applications. The Utility Solutions segment provides critical components that allow the grid to reliably transmit and distribute energy, as well as the communications and controls technologies to make the grid smarter and more flexible. This includes utility transmission & distribution (T&D) components such as arresters, insulators, connectors, anchors, bushings, enclosures, cutouts and switches. The Utility Solutions segment also offers solutions that serve The Edge of the utility infrastructure, including smart meters, communications systems, and protection and control devices. Hubbell Utility Solutions ","zh":"Hubbell Utility Solutions 在儀表前端和邊緣領域處於領先地位。公用事业解决方案部门（2025 年占综合收入的 63%，2024 年占 64%，2023 年占 61%）由使电网能够跨公用事业应用传导、通信和控制能源的业务组成。公用事业解决方案部门提供关键组件，使电网能够可靠地传输和分配能源，以及通信和控制技术，使电网更智能、更灵活。這包括公用事業輸配電 (T&D) 組件，例如避雷器、絕緣子、連接器、錨、套管、外殼、切口和開關。公用事业解决方案部门还提供服务于公用事业基础设施边缘的解决方案，包括智能电表、通信系统以及保护和控制设备。哈貝爾公用事業解決方案"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Hubbell Utility Solutions has leading positions In Front of the Meter and on The Edge. The Utility Solutions segment (63% of consolidated revenues in 2025, 64% in 2024 and 61% in 2023) consists of businesses that enable the grid to conduct, communicate and control energy across utility applications. The Utility Solutions segment provides critical components that allow the grid to reliably transmit and distribute energy, as well as the communications and controls technologies to make the grid smarter and more flexible. This includes utility transmission & distribution (T&D) components such as arresters, insulators, connectors, anchors, bushings, enclosures, cutouts and switches. The Utility Solutions segment also offers solutions that serve The Edge of the utility infrastructure, including smart meters, communications systems, and protection and control devices. Hubbell Utility Solutions ","zh":"Hubbell Utility Solutions 在儀表前端和邊緣領域處於領先地位。公用事业解决方案部门（2025 年占综合收入的 63%，2024 年占 64%，2023 年占 61%）由使电网能够跨公用事业应用传导、通信和控制能源的业务组成。公用事业解决方案部门提供关键组件，使电网能够可靠地传输和分配能源，以及通信和控制技术，使电网更智能、更灵活。這包括公用事業輸配電 (T&D) 組件，例如避雷器、絕緣子、連接器、錨、套管、外殼、切口和開關。公用事业解决方案部门还提供服务于公用事业基础设施边缘的解决方案，包括智能电表、通信系统以及保护和控制设备。哈貝爾公用事業解決方案"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Utility Solutions","val":3672300000,"zh":"公用事業解決方案部門"},{"name":"Electrical","val":2172300000,"zh":"電氣部門"}],"total":5844600000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":5411300000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":433300000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":5844600000}},"peers":["IEX","LII","TT","NDSN","AME"]}}